    "raw": "<div class=\"html-edited\"><div id=\"halo-manual-id\" style=\"display:none;\">9b213cb3-dc1b-4cb4-a096-e443679e7801</div></div><div class=\"html-edited\"><style>\n/* demo 模块 1：导航条 CSS */\n.nav-quote-box {\n  border-left: 5px solid #ff0000;\n  padding-left: 15px;\n  margin: 10px 0;\n}\n\nhtml[data-user-color-scheme=\"dark\"] .nav-quote-box,\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .nav-quote-box {\n    border-left-color: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n}\n\n.nav-quote-box .nav-quote-title {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin: 0 0 0.15rem;\n}\n\n.nav-quote-box .nav-quote-sub {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  opacity: 0.75;\n}\n</style><div class=\"nav-quote-box font-en\">\n<p class=\"nav-quote-title\">导航栏</p>\n<p class=\"nav-quote-sub\">NAVIGATION BAR · 流浪世界 Wiki</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"html-edited\"><style>\n/* 自 demo 导出：全息交互卡片 CSS（Halo 独立 HTML 块，配 wanderCard 脚本） */\n\n.wander-smart-container {\n  width: 100%;\n  margin-top: 25px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  padding: 10px;\n}\n\n.font-cn {\n  font-family: \"ZiHun-59-ChuangCuHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif !important;\n}\n\n.font-en {\n  font-family: \"Rajdhani-Medium\", \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif !important;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 2.35 / 1;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #000;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n  transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n  --x: 50%;\n  --y: 50%;\n}\n\n.wd-rainbow-border {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 1;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    120deg,\n    #091018,\n    #2b4c5d,\n    #0077be,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #ffffff,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #0077be,\n    #2b4c5d,\n    #091018\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 200%;\n  animation: rainbow-flow 15s linear infinite;\n  clip-path: circle(0% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  transition: clip-path 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n@keyframes rainbow-flow {\n  0% {\n    background-position: 0% 50%;\n  }\n  100% {\n    background-position: 200% 50%;\n  }\n}\n\n.wd-inner-mask {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 1px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #000;\n  z-index: 2;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.wd-static-bg {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -10px;\n  background-size: cover;\n  background-position: center;\n  filter: blur(2px);\n  opacity: 1;\n  transition: filter 0.5s ease, opacity 0.5s ease;\n  z-index: 3;\n}\n\n.wd-lazy-video {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  opacity: 0;\n  z-index: 4;\n  transition: opacity 0.8s ease;\n}\n\n.wd-inner-mask::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 35%, transparent 60%);\n  z-index: 5;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.wd-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 6;\n  height: 100%;\n  padding: 30px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.wd-title {\n  font-size: 42px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  line-height: 1;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.wd-meta-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #d1d5db;\n  text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n}\n\n.wd-divider {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 12px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card:hover .wd-rainbow-border,\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing .wd-rainbow-border {\n  clip-path: circle(150% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  animation-duration: 2s;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing .wd-static-bg {\n  filter: blur(0px);\n  opacity: 0;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing .wd-lazy-video {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing {\n  box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n  transform: translateY(-3px);\n  border-color: transparent;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .wd-smart-card {\n    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  }\n  .wd-title {\n    font-size: 28px;\n  }\n  .wd-content {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .wd-meta-bar {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n}\n</style><div class=\"wander-smart-container font-cn\">\n<a class=\"wd-smart-card font-en\" id=\"wanderCard\" href=\"/archives/player\">\n<div class=\"wd-rainbow-border\"></div>\n<div class=\"wd-inner-mask\">\n<div class=\"wd-static-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('/upload/%E7%8C%AB.jpg');\"></div>\n<video class=\"wd-lazy-video\" muted loop playsinline poster=\"/upload/%E7%8C%AB.jpg\"><source src=\"/upload/world_preview.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n<div class=\"wd-content\">\n<div class=\"wd-title font-cn\">进入流浪的世界</div>\n<div class=\"wd-meta-bar font-en\">\n<span>WORLD BUILDING</span>\n<span class=\"wd-divider\"></span>\n<span>玩家 Wiki · 世界观与运行逻辑</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div><script>\n(function () {\n  const card = document.getElementById(\"wanderCard\");\n  if (!card) return;\n  const video = card.querySelector(\"video\");\n  const isMobile = /Android|webOS|iPhone|iPad|iPod|BlackBerry|IEMobile|Opera Mini/i.test(\n    navigator.userAgent\n  );\n  function updateMousePosition(e) {\n    const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n    card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", e.clientX - rect.left + \"px\");\n    card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", e.clientY - rect.top + \"px\");\n  }\n  if (isMobile) {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      (entries) => {\n        entries.forEach((entry) => {\n          if (entry.isIntersecting && entry.intersectionRatio >= 0.95) {\n            card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", \"50%\");\n            card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", \"50%\");\n            if (video && video.src) {\n              video.play().then(() => card.classList.add(\"is-playing\")).catch(() => {});\n            } else {\n              card.classList.add(\"is-playing\");\n            }\n          } else {\n            if (video) video.pause();\n            card.classList.remove(\"is-playing\");\n          }\n        });\n      },\n      { threshold: [0.95] }\n    );\n    observer.observe(card);\n  } else {\n    card.addEventListener(\"mouseenter\", (e) => {\n      updateMousePosition(e);\n      if (video && video.src) {\n        video.play().then(() => card.classList.add(\"is-playing\")).catch(() => {});\n      } else {\n        card.classList.add(\"is-playing\");\n      }\n    });\n    card.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", updateMousePosition);\n    card.addEventListener(\"mouseleave\", () => {\n      card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", \"50%\");\n      card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", \"50%\");\n      if (video) video.pause();\n      card.classList.remove(\"is-playing\");\n    });\n  }\n})();\n</script></div><div class=\"html-edited\"><style>\n/* MCWWS Wiki · Halo / 本地预览共用（class 前缀 mcwws-） */\n\n.mcwws-root {\n  --mcwws-accent: #00f2ff;\n  --mcwws-accent-dim: #0077be;\n  --mcwws-bg: #0a0e14;\n  --mcwws-surface: #121820;\n  --mcwws-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  --mcwws-text: #e5e7eb;\n  --mcwws-muted: #9ca3af;\n  font-family: system-ui, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  color: var(--mcwws-text);\n  margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-nav {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n  border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\nhtml[data-user-color-scheme=\"dark\"] .mcwws-nav,\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .mcwws-nav { border-left-color: #fff; }\n}\n\n.mcwws-nav a {\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.mcwws-nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n.mcwws-nav-sep { color: var(--mcwws-muted); user-select: none; }\n\n.mcwws-hero {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 2rem 1rem 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-hero h1 {\n  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n\n.mcwws-hero p {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--mcwws-muted);\n  max-width: 36rem;\n  margin-inline: auto;\n}\n\n.mcwws-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n  padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  background: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.12);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.35);\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n}\n\n.mcwws-card-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  margin: 1.5rem 0;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card {\n  display: block;\n  position: relative;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  color: inherit !important;\n  background: #000;\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  min-height: 160px;\n  transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;\n  --x: 50%;\n  --y: 50%;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card:hover,\n.mcwws-smart-card.mcwws-is-active {\n  transform: translateY(-3px);\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);\n  border-color: transparent;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__glow {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 1;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    120deg,\n    #091018,\n    #2b4c5d,\n    #0077be,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #fff,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #0077be,\n    #091018\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 200%;\n  animation: mcwws-flow 12s linear infinite;\n  clip-path: circle(0% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  transition: clip-path 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card:hover .mcwws-smart-card__glow,\n.mcwws-smart-card.mcwws-is-active .mcwws-smart-card__glow {\n  clip-path: circle(150% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  animation-duration: 2.5s;\n}\n\n@keyframes mcwws-flow {\n  0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n  100% { background-position: 200% 50%; }\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__inner {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  margin: 1px;\n  border-radius: 11px;\n  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f1419 0%, #1a2332 100%);\n  padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem;\n  min-height: 158px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__tag {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__title {\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0 0 0.35rem;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__desc {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--mcwws-muted);\n  margin: 0;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps {\n  counter-reset: mcwws-step;\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 1.25rem 0;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps li {\n  counter-increment: mcwws-step;\n  margin: 0 0 0.65rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps a {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.85rem;\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  color: var(--mcwws-text) !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps a:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.45);\n  background: #151c28;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps a::before {\n  content: counter(mcwws-step);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 2rem;\n  line-height: 2rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  background: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.15);\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n}\n\n.mcwws-chip-row {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin: 1rem 0;\n}\n\n.mcwws-chip {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  color: var(--mcwws-text) !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.mcwws-chip:hover {\n  border-color: var(--mcwws-accent-dim);\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent) !important;\n}\n\n.mcwws-details {\n  margin: 1rem 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.mcwws-details summary {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.mcwws-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n\n.mcwws-details[open] summary {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n}\n\n.mcwws-details__body {\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem 1rem;\n  font-size: 0.92rem;\n  color: var(--mcwws-muted);\n}\n\n.mcwws-md-fallback {\n  margin-top: 2rem;\n  padding-top: 1.5rem;\n  border-top: 1px dashed var(--mcwws-border);\n}\n</style><div class=\"mcwws-root\">\n<section class=\"mcwws-hero\">\n<h1>流浪世界</h1>\n<p><strong>RYAN STUDIO · 流浪世界</strong> — Paper 1.21.11 生存服。下方为文档分轨入口。</p>\n<span class=\"mcwws-badge\">机制与物价以游戏内及网页商店为准</span>\n</section>\n<div class=\"mcwws-card-grid\">\n<a class=\"mcwws-smart-card\" href=\"/archives/player\">\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__glow\"></div>\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__inner\">\n<span class=\"mcwws-smart-card__tag\">Player</span>\n<h2 class=\"mcwws-smart-card__title\">玩家 Wiki</h2>\n<p class=\"mcwws-smart-card__desc\">进服、规则、指令、物价、地图与社区。</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"mcwws-smart-card\" href=\"/archives/developer\">\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__glow\"></div>\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__inner\">\n<span class=\"mcwws-smart-card__tag\">Developer</span>\n<h2 class=\"mcwws-smart-card__title\">开发者文档</h2>\n<p class=\"mcwws-smart-card__desc\">MCWWS、Skript、资源清单与构建约定。</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mcwws-chip-row\">\n<a class=\"mcwws-chip\" href=\"/archives/player/getting-started\">新手上路</a>\n<a class=\"mcwws-chip\" href=\"/archives/player/server-world/prices\">物价</a>\n<a class=\"mcwws-chip\" href=\"/archives/developer/guide\">开发者指南</a>\n</div>\n</div><script>\n(function () {\n  function bindSmartCards(root) {\n    var cards = (root || document).querySelectorAll(\".mcwws-smart-card\");\n    cards.forEach(function (card) {\n      function setPos(e) {\n        var r = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", e.clientX - r.left + \"px\");\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", e.clientY - r.top + \"px\");\n      }\n      card.addEventListener(\"mouseenter\", setPos);\n      card.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", setPos);\n      card.addEventListener(\"focus\", function () {\n        card.classList.add(\"mcwws-is-active\");\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", \"50%\");\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", \"50%\");\n      });\n      card.addEventListener(\"blur\", function () {\n        card.classList.remove(\"mcwws-is-active\");\n      });\n    });\n  }\n  if (document.readyState === \"loading\") {\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n      bindSmartCards(document);\n    });\n  } else {\n    bindSmartCards(document);\n  }\n})();\n\n\n<div class=\"mcwws-md-fallback\">\n\n## 路径说明（纯文本备用）\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **[玩家 Wiki →](player/index.md)** | 进服、规则、指令、物价、地图、世界百科、日记 |\n| **[开发者文档 →](developer/index.md)** | 仓库协作、插件与脚本、资源清单、软硬件与规划 |\n\n仓库内 Markdown 约定见 [wiki/README.md](README.md)。\n\n</div>\n</script></div>",
    "content": "<div class=\"html-edited\"><div id=\"halo-manual-id\" style=\"display:none;\">9b213cb3-dc1b-4cb4-a096-e443679e7801</div></div><div class=\"html-edited\"><style>\n/* demo 模块 1：导航条 CSS */\n.nav-quote-box {\n  border-left: 5px solid #ff0000;\n  padding-left: 15px;\n  margin: 10px 0;\n}\n\nhtml[data-user-color-scheme=\"dark\"] .nav-quote-box,\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .nav-quote-box {\n    border-left-color: #ffffff !important;\n  }\n}\n\n.nav-quote-box .nav-quote-title {\n  font-weight: 700;\n  letter-spacing: 0.08em;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  margin: 0 0 0.15rem;\n}\n\n.nav-quote-box .nav-quote-sub {\n  margin: 0;\n  font-size: 0.85rem;\n  opacity: 0.75;\n}\n</style><div class=\"nav-quote-box font-en\">\n<p class=\"nav-quote-title\">导航栏</p>\n<p class=\"nav-quote-sub\">NAVIGATION BAR · 流浪世界 Wiki</p>\n</div></div><div class=\"html-edited\"><style>\n/* 自 demo 导出：全息交互卡片 CSS（Halo 独立 HTML 块，配 wanderCard 脚本） */\n\n.wander-smart-container {\n  width: 100%;\n  margin-top: 25px;\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  padding: 10px;\n}\n\n.font-cn {\n  font-family: \"ZiHun-59-ChuangCuHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif !important;\n}\n\n.font-en {\n  font-family: \"Rajdhani-Medium\", \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif !important;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card {\n  display: block;\n  width: 100%;\n  aspect-ratio: 2.35 / 1;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  position: relative;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background: #000;\n  border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  box-shadow: 0 15px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);\n  transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.25, 0.8, 0.25, 1);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;\n  --x: 50%;\n  --y: 50%;\n}\n\n.wd-rainbow-border {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 1;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    120deg,\n    #091018,\n    #2b4c5d,\n    #0077be,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #ffffff,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #0077be,\n    #2b4c5d,\n    #091018\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 200%;\n  animation: rainbow-flow 15s linear infinite;\n  clip-path: circle(0% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  transition: clip-path 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n@keyframes rainbow-flow {\n  0% {\n    background-position: 0% 50%;\n  }\n  100% {\n    background-position: 200% 50%;\n  }\n}\n\n.wd-inner-mask {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 1px;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: #000;\n  z-index: 2;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.wd-static-bg {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: -10px;\n  background-size: cover;\n  background-position: center;\n  filter: blur(2px);\n  opacity: 1;\n  transition: filter 0.5s ease, opacity 0.5s ease;\n  z-index: 3;\n}\n\n.wd-lazy-video {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n  width: 100%;\n  height: 100%;\n  object-fit: cover;\n  opacity: 0;\n  z-index: 4;\n  transition: opacity 0.8s ease;\n}\n\n.wd-inner-mask::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  background: linear-gradient(to top, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95) 0%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 35%, transparent 60%);\n  z-index: 5;\n  pointer-events: none;\n}\n\n.wd-content {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 6;\n  height: 100%;\n  padding: 30px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.wd-title {\n  font-size: 42px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  color: #ffffff;\n  line-height: 1;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n  text-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 1);\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.wd-meta-bar {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 12px;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  color: #d1d5db;\n  text-shadow: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n}\n\n.wd-divider {\n  width: 1px;\n  height: 12px;\n  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n  display: inline-block;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card:hover .wd-rainbow-border,\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing .wd-rainbow-border {\n  clip-path: circle(150% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  animation-duration: 2s;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing .wd-static-bg {\n  filter: blur(0px);\n  opacity: 0;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing .wd-lazy-video {\n  opacity: 1;\n}\n\n.wd-smart-card.is-playing {\n  box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);\n  transform: translateY(-3px);\n  border-color: transparent;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 768px) {\n  .wd-smart-card {\n    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;\n  }\n  .wd-title {\n    font-size: 28px;\n  }\n  .wd-content {\n    padding: 20px;\n  }\n  .wd-meta-bar {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    gap: 8px;\n  }\n}\n</style><div class=\"wander-smart-container font-cn\">\n<a class=\"wd-smart-card font-en\" id=\"wanderCard\" href=\"/archives/player\">\n<div class=\"wd-rainbow-border\"></div>\n<div class=\"wd-inner-mask\">\n<div class=\"wd-static-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('/upload/%E7%8C%AB.jpg');\"></div>\n<video class=\"wd-lazy-video\" muted loop playsinline poster=\"/upload/%E7%8C%AB.jpg\"><source src=\"/upload/world_preview.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video>\n<div class=\"wd-content\">\n<div class=\"wd-title font-cn\">进入流浪的世界</div>\n<div class=\"wd-meta-bar font-en\">\n<span>WORLD BUILDING</span>\n<span class=\"wd-divider\"></span>\n<span>玩家 Wiki · 世界观与运行逻辑</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div><script>\n(function () {\n  const card = document.getElementById(\"wanderCard\");\n  if (!card) return;\n  const video = card.querySelector(\"video\");\n  const isMobile = /Android|webOS|iPhone|iPad|iPod|BlackBerry|IEMobile|Opera Mini/i.test(\n    navigator.userAgent\n  );\n  function updateMousePosition(e) {\n    const rect = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n    card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", e.clientX - rect.left + \"px\");\n    card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", e.clientY - rect.top + \"px\");\n  }\n  if (isMobile) {\n    const observer = new IntersectionObserver(\n      (entries) => {\n        entries.forEach((entry) => {\n          if (entry.isIntersecting && entry.intersectionRatio >= 0.95) {\n            card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", \"50%\");\n            card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", \"50%\");\n            if (video && video.src) {\n              video.play().then(() => card.classList.add(\"is-playing\")).catch(() => {});\n            } else {\n              card.classList.add(\"is-playing\");\n            }\n          } else {\n            if (video) video.pause();\n            card.classList.remove(\"is-playing\");\n          }\n        });\n      },\n      { threshold: [0.95] }\n    );\n    observer.observe(card);\n  } else {\n    card.addEventListener(\"mouseenter\", (e) => {\n      updateMousePosition(e);\n      if (video && video.src) {\n        video.play().then(() => card.classList.add(\"is-playing\")).catch(() => {});\n      } else {\n        card.classList.add(\"is-playing\");\n      }\n    });\n    card.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", updateMousePosition);\n    card.addEventListener(\"mouseleave\", () => {\n      card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", \"50%\");\n      card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", \"50%\");\n      if (video) video.pause();\n      card.classList.remove(\"is-playing\");\n    });\n  }\n})();\n</script></div><div class=\"html-edited\"><style>\n/* MCWWS Wiki · Halo / 本地预览共用（class 前缀 mcwws-） */\n\n.mcwws-root {\n  --mcwws-accent: #00f2ff;\n  --mcwws-accent-dim: #0077be;\n  --mcwws-bg: #0a0e14;\n  --mcwws-surface: #121820;\n  --mcwws-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n  --mcwws-text: #e5e7eb;\n  --mcwws-muted: #9ca3af;\n  font-family: system-ui, \"Segoe UI\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  color: var(--mcwws-text);\n  margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-nav {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.5rem 1rem;\n  padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n  border-left: 4px solid #ef4444;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\nhtml[data-user-color-scheme=\"dark\"] .mcwws-nav,\n@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {\n  .mcwws-nav { border-left-color: #fff; }\n}\n\n.mcwws-nav a {\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n  text-decoration: none;\n}\n\n.mcwws-nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n.mcwws-nav-sep { color: var(--mcwws-muted); user-select: none; }\n\n.mcwws-hero {\n  text-align: center;\n  padding: 2rem 1rem 1.5rem;\n  margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-hero h1 {\n  font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n  margin: 0 0 0.5rem;\n  letter-spacing: 0.02em;\n}\n\n.mcwws-hero p {\n  margin: 0;\n  color: var(--mcwws-muted);\n  max-width: 36rem;\n  margin-inline: auto;\n}\n\n.mcwws-badge {\n  display: inline-block;\n  margin-top: 1rem;\n  padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 0.8rem;\n  background: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.12);\n  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.35);\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n}\n\n.mcwws-card-grid {\n  display: grid;\n  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));\n  gap: 1.25rem;\n  margin: 1.5rem 0;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card {\n  display: block;\n  position: relative;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  color: inherit !important;\n  background: #000;\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  min-height: 160px;\n  transition: transform 0.35s ease, box-shadow 0.35s ease;\n  --x: 50%;\n  --y: 50%;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card:hover,\n.mcwws-smart-card.mcwws-is-active {\n  transform: translateY(-3px);\n  box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);\n  border-color: transparent;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__glow {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  z-index: 1;\n  pointer-events: none;\n  background: linear-gradient(\n    120deg,\n    #091018,\n    #2b4c5d,\n    #0077be,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #fff,\n    #00f2ff,\n    #0077be,\n    #091018\n  );\n  background-size: 200% 200%;\n  animation: mcwws-flow 12s linear infinite;\n  clip-path: circle(0% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  transition: clip-path 0.55s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card:hover .mcwws-smart-card__glow,\n.mcwws-smart-card.mcwws-is-active .mcwws-smart-card__glow {\n  clip-path: circle(150% at var(--x) var(--y));\n  animation-duration: 2.5s;\n}\n\n@keyframes mcwws-flow {\n  0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }\n  100% { background-position: 200% 50%; }\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__inner {\n  position: relative;\n  z-index: 2;\n  margin: 1px;\n  border-radius: 11px;\n  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #0f1419 0%, #1a2332 100%);\n  padding: 1.35rem 1.25rem;\n  min-height: 158px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  justify-content: flex-end;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__tag {\n  font-size: 0.7rem;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 0.12em;\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__title {\n  font-size: 1.35rem;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  margin: 0 0 0.35rem;\n  line-height: 1.2;\n}\n\n.mcwws-smart-card__desc {\n  font-size: 0.88rem;\n  color: var(--mcwws-muted);\n  margin: 0;\n  line-height: 1.45;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps {\n  counter-reset: mcwws-step;\n  list-style: none;\n  padding: 0;\n  margin: 1.25rem 0;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps li {\n  counter-increment: mcwws-step;\n  margin: 0 0 0.65rem;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps a {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 0.85rem;\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  color: var(--mcwws-text) !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, background 0.2s;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps a:hover {\n  border-color: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.45);\n  background: #151c28;\n}\n\n.mcwws-steps a::before {\n  content: counter(mcwws-step);\n  flex-shrink: 0;\n  width: 2rem;\n  height: 2rem;\n  line-height: 2rem;\n  text-align: center;\n  border-radius: 8px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  font-size: 0.9rem;\n  background: rgba(0, 242, 255, 0.15);\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent);\n}\n\n.mcwws-chip-row {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: 0.5rem;\n  margin: 1rem 0;\n}\n\n.mcwws-chip {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;\n  border-radius: 999px;\n  font-size: 0.82rem;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  color: var(--mcwws-text) !important;\n  text-decoration: none !important;\n  transition: border-color 0.2s, color 0.2s;\n}\n\n.mcwws-chip:hover {\n  border-color: var(--mcwws-accent-dim);\n  color: var(--mcwws-accent) !important;\n}\n\n.mcwws-details {\n  margin: 1rem 0;\n  border: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  background: var(--mcwws-surface);\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.mcwws-details summary {\n  cursor: pointer;\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.mcwws-details summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n\n.mcwws-details[open] summary {\n  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mcwws-border);\n}\n\n.mcwws-details__body {\n  padding: 0.85rem 1rem 1rem;\n  font-size: 0.92rem;\n  color: var(--mcwws-muted);\n}\n\n.mcwws-md-fallback {\n  margin-top: 2rem;\n  padding-top: 1.5rem;\n  border-top: 1px dashed var(--mcwws-border);\n}\n</style><div class=\"mcwws-root\">\n<section class=\"mcwws-hero\">\n<h1>流浪世界</h1>\n<p><strong>RYAN STUDIO · 流浪世界</strong> — Paper 1.21.11 生存服。下方为文档分轨入口。</p>\n<span class=\"mcwws-badge\">机制与物价以游戏内及网页商店为准</span>\n</section>\n<div class=\"mcwws-card-grid\">\n<a class=\"mcwws-smart-card\" href=\"/archives/player\">\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__glow\"></div>\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__inner\">\n<span class=\"mcwws-smart-card__tag\">Player</span>\n<h2 class=\"mcwws-smart-card__title\">玩家 Wiki</h2>\n<p class=\"mcwws-smart-card__desc\">进服、规则、指令、物价、地图与社区。</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"mcwws-smart-card\" href=\"/archives/developer\">\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__glow\"></div>\n<div class=\"mcwws-smart-card__inner\">\n<span class=\"mcwws-smart-card__tag\">Developer</span>\n<h2 class=\"mcwws-smart-card__title\">开发者文档</h2>\n<p class=\"mcwws-smart-card__desc\">MCWWS、Skript、资源清单与构建约定。</p>\n</div>\n</a>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mcwws-chip-row\">\n<a class=\"mcwws-chip\" href=\"/archives/player/getting-started\">新手上路</a>\n<a class=\"mcwws-chip\" href=\"/archives/player/server-world/prices\">物价</a>\n<a class=\"mcwws-chip\" href=\"/archives/developer/guide\">开发者指南</a>\n</div>\n</div><script>\n(function () {\n  function bindSmartCards(root) {\n    var cards = (root || document).querySelectorAll(\".mcwws-smart-card\");\n    cards.forEach(function (card) {\n      function setPos(e) {\n        var r = card.getBoundingClientRect();\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", e.clientX - r.left + \"px\");\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", e.clientY - r.top + \"px\");\n      }\n      card.addEventListener(\"mouseenter\", setPos);\n      card.addEventListener(\"mousemove\", setPos);\n      card.addEventListener(\"focus\", function () {\n        card.classList.add(\"mcwws-is-active\");\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--x\", \"50%\");\n        card.style.setProperty(\"--y\", \"50%\");\n      });\n      card.addEventListener(\"blur\", function () {\n        card.classList.remove(\"mcwws-is-active\");\n      });\n    });\n  }\n  if (document.readyState === \"loading\") {\n    document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", function () {\n      bindSmartCards(document);\n    });\n  } else {\n    bindSmartCards(document);\n  }\n})();\n\n\n<div class=\"mcwws-md-fallback\">\n\n## 路径说明（纯文本备用）\n\n| | |\n|---|---|\n| **[玩家 Wiki →](player/index.md)** | 进服、规则、指令、物价、地图、世界百科、日记 |\n| **[开发者文档 →](developer/index.md)** | 仓库协作、插件与脚本、资源清单、软硬件与规划 |\n\n仓库内 Markdown 约定见 [wiki/README.md](README.md)。\n\n</div>\n</script></div>",
    "rawType": "html"
  }
}